try %^)

Long way to go, but he is coming back.  This is removing a lot of pressure
on me - the amount of Lojban work I was getting done decreased all last week.
But I think I can go back to work tomorrow.

Some people are on a daily status list for Athelstan's conditions.  If you
aren't and would like to be, send  arequest to glenn@bessel.umd.edu
